  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`edit.delete`: removes the selected records with everything the delete policies take along\n(FR-DEV-030), in **one** delete plan for all targets (`TxBuilder::delete_many`): the result does not\ndepend on the order of the targets, a target that another target's cascade removes is planned once,\nand a target listed twice counts once. Deleting a representation leaves its function unplaced (an IP\nfunction goes with it); deleting a device removes its functions, their representations and\nconnections. A target that does not exist at the start is `NotFound`; a forbid link (a strip with\nterminals, a referenced structure node) rejects the whole command (`ModelError::Referenced`). Cost:\n`Bulk` when the plan removes or changes more than 500 records (D4; the plan is computed once by\n`cost`). A released or withdrawn revision is immutable (FR-REV-009): naming one is refused at\n`/targets/<i>`; the open revision may be deleted. A deleted page takes the open revision's note on it along\n(FT-303, WP-S1.18 D5). Outcome: none.",
  "properties": {
    "targets": {
      "description": "The selected records, at least one.",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/TargetRef"
      },
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "targets"
  ],
  "title": "edit.delete",
  "type": "object"
}
